/* Fenêtre d'impression des diplômes (A4 paysage, un par page). cssPlus : styles
   propres à un modèle (le diplôme ultime a son fond de nuit). */
function dipFenetre(pages,titre,cssPlus){
  const w=window.open("","_blank","width=1000,height=760");
  if(!w){ toast("Autorisez les fenêtres pop-up pour imprimer."); return; }
  const base=location.href.replace(/[#?].*$/,"").replace(/[^/]*$/,"");
  const css='@page{size:A4 landscape;margin:0}'
    +'*{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}'
    +'body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#16233a;background:#fbf8ef}'
    +'.dip{position:relative;width:297mm;height:209.5mm;overflow:hidden;break-after:page;page-break-after:always;background:#fbf8ef}'
    +'.dip:last-child{break-after:auto;page-break-after:auto}'
    +'.dip-in{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:1123px;height:794px;transform:scale(.9975);transform-origin:0 0}'
    +'.dip-scotch{position:absolute;width:130px;height:34px;background:#F2C94C;opacity:.85}'
    +'.dip-bande{margin-top:18px;width:580px;height:62px;background:#F2C94C;transform:rotate(-2.5deg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;'
    +'clip-path:polygon(0 8%,2% 0,4% 10%,6% 0,94% 0,96% 12%,98% 0,100% 10%,100% 92%,98% 100%,96% 88%,94% 100%,6% 100%,4% 90%,2% 100%,0 90%)}'
    +'.dip-bande span{font-family:"Baloo 2",sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:29px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#1e3a63;padding-top:4px}'
    +'.dip-nom{font-family:"Baloo 2",sans-serif;font-weight:800;line-height:1.05;color:#1e3a63;white-space:nowrap;position:relative}'
    +'.dip-etiq{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1px;padding:8px 14px;border:2px dashed #1e3a63;border-radius:12px}'
    +'.dip-etiq span{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#4f5f76}'
    +'.dip-etiq b{font-family:"Baloo 2",sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;color:#1e3a63}'
    +'.dip-n1{position:absolute;right:104px;bottom:272px;width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;background:#F2C94C;border:6px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(30,58,99,.25);'
    +'transform:rotate(10deg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px}'
    +'.dip-n1 b{font-family:"Baloo 2",sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:40px;line-height:1;color:#1e3a63}'
    +'.dip-n1 span{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1e3a63}'
    +'@media screen{body{background:#8a97a8;padding:16px}.dip{margin:0 auto 16px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}}'
    +DIP_CSS_U+(cssPlus||"");
  w.document.write('<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><base href="'+base+'"><title>'+echapH(titre)+'</title>'
    +'<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Permanent+Marker&display=swap">'
    +'<style>'+css+'</style></head><body>'+pages.join("")
    +'<script>window.addEventListener("load",function(){var f=(document.fonts&&document.fonts.ready)?document.fonts.ready:Promise.resolve();'
    +'f.then(function(){setTimeout(function(){window.focus();window.print();},250);});});<\/script></body></html>');
  w.document.close();
}
